  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORSAR - Monitoring of the conflict in Ukraine - Surveillance of critical infra, humanitarian protection and promote international justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the ongoing war in Ukraine, NORSAR has demonstrated for the first time how seismic data can be used as an objective tool for monitoring active conflict zones. Seismometers, which measure ground vibrations, and infrasound sensors which detect pressure waves in the atmosphere, can record the impact of violent explosions caused by bombs and missile strikes. 

The expected impact of this contribution is strengthened protection of civilians, improved global security and strengthened international justice through independent and objective surveillance of war-related explosions in Ukriane.</narrative>
  </description>
